---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import NavBar from "../components/NavBar.astro";
import FooterSection from "../components/FooterSection.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Aetherion: Architecture & Spatial Design"
  description="Privacy Policy detailing how [Agency Name] collects, uses, and safeguards personal and project inquiry information."
>
  <NavBar />

  <main class="bg-canvas text-ink w-full pt-32 pb-24 md:pt-40 md:pb-32">
    <div class="section-container">
      <div class="section-divider flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 md:flex-row md:items-end">
        <div>
          <span class="text-section-label block">Legal</span>
          <h1 class="text-display mt-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
        </div>
        <p class="text-meta md:text-right">
          Effective Date: [Effective Date]
        </p>
      </div>

      <article class="mt-12 max-w-3xl space-y-12 md:mt-16">
        <section class="space-y-4">
          <p class="text-body text-base leading-relaxed sm:text-[17px]">
            [Agency Name] ("we", "our", or "us") operates this website to present our architectural portfolio and receive project inquiries from prospective clients, collaborators, and press contacts. This Privacy Policy explains what personal data we collect when you visit our site or contact our studio, how we use that data, and the rights available to you.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="privacy-data-collection" class="space-y-4 border-t border-ink/15 pt-8">
          <h2 id="privacy-data-collection" class="text-card-title sm:text-2xl">
            1. Data Collection
          </h2>
          <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
            We collect information that you voluntarily provide when submitting our project inquiry form or corresponding with our studio by email or telephone. Depending on the scope of your inquiry, this information includes:
          </p>
          <ul class="text-body list-disc space-y-2.5 pl-5 leading-relaxed">
            <li>
              Your full name, email address, telephone number, and company or organization name.
            </li>
            <li>
              Project parameters such as site location, property type, estimated construction budget, target timeline, and architectural brief details.
            </li>
            <li>
              Records of correspondence if you contact our studio directly at [Contact Email].
            </li>
            <li>
              Standard technical logs transmitted by your browser, including IP address, browser version, operating system, referring URLs, and pages viewed.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
            We use this information strictly to evaluate project feasibility, respond to your architectural or design inquiries, prepare fee proposals, and maintain the security of our website.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="privacy-cookies" class="space-y-4 border-t border-ink/15 pt-8">
          <h2 id="privacy-cookies" class="text-card-title sm:text-2xl">
            2. Cookies &amp; Local Storage
          </h2>
          <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
            Our website uses minimal cookies and browser storage required to deliver pages reliably and measure aggregate site performance. All typography on this site is self-hosted so your browser does not transmit font requests to external content delivery networks.
          </p>
          <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
            You can configure your browser to block or delete cookies at any time. Blocking strictly necessary cookies may affect certain interactive form behaviors on the site.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="privacy-third-parties" class="space-y-4 border-t border-ink/15 pt-8">
          <h2 id="privacy-third-parties" class="text-card-title sm:text-2xl">
            3. Third-Party Services &amp; Data Retention
          </h2>
          <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
            We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. We share inquiry data only with vetted service providers that help us operate our studio infrastructure, such as our web hosting provider, email service, and client relationship management system. Each provider is bound by confidentiality and data-processing obligations.
          </p>
          <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
            We retain project inquiry records for [Retention Period, e.g., 24 months] after our last interaction, or longer where required to fulfill an active architectural engagement, comply with statutory tax and accounting obligations, or maintain professional archival records.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="privacy-user-rights" class="space-y-4 border-t border-ink/15 pt-8">
          <h2 id="privacy-user-rights" class="text-card-title sm:text-2xl">
            4. Your Privacy Rights
          </h2>
          <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
            Depending on your jurisdiction, including under the GDPR, UK GDPR, or CCPA, you have specific rights regarding the personal data we hold about you:
          </p>
          <ul class="text-body list-disc space-y-2.5 pl-5 leading-relaxed">
            <li>
              Request a copy of the personal data and project inquiry records we hold about you.
            </li>
            <li>
              Ask us to correct inaccurate or incomplete contact details.
            </li>
            <li>
              Request deletion of your personal data when it is no longer required for an active contract or legal obligation.
            </li>
            <li>
              Object to or restrict specific processing activities, or withdraw consent where processing is based on consent.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
            To exercise any of these rights, please send a written request to [Contact Email]. We will respond within the timeframe required by applicable law in [Jurisdiction].
          </p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="privacy-contact" class="space-y-4 border-t border-ink/15 pt-8">
          <h2 id="privacy-contact" class="text-card-title sm:text-2xl">
            5. Studio Contact Information
          </h2>
          <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
            If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how [Agency Name] handles your data, please contact our studio at [Contact Email] or by mail at [Studio Address].
          </p>
          <div class="pt-4">
            <a href="/#contact" class="btn-primary">
              Contact Our Studio
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>

  <FooterSection />
</Layout>
